cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the accompanying paper."
title: "Elliptic units for complex cubic fields"
abstract: >-
  Sage code evaluating a certified smoothed elliptic gamma function attached to
  a wedge of hyperplanes, producing conjectural elliptic units generating ray
  class fields of complex cubic fields.
type: software
